(a) It shall be a code violation punishable as set forth herein when intervention at the same location to abate a gathering constituting a public nuisance occurs within any posting periods set forth in section after the property was posted:
(1) For the first intervention in a posting period the fine shall be a minimum mandatory $300.00;
(2) For the second intervention in a posting period the fine shall be a minimum mandatory $400.00;
(3) For any further responses in a posting period the fine shall be a minimum mandatory $500.00.
(b) In addition to the above, the state court shall be authorized to order the person or persons in violation to perform community service. For a first-time intervention ordering community service shall be discretionary for a second or third intervention, the state court shall, in addition to the monetary penalty set forth above, order the person or persons in violation to perform not less than 25 hours of community service for a second intervention and not less than 50 hours of community service for a third intervention.
(Ord. No. 2022-7, § 3, 8-11-2022)

